{:paths ["src"]

 ;; A library from before the runtime provided java.util.zip.CRC32, still
 ;; claiming it — the shape every project pinned to an older jolt-lang/http-client
 ;; release met when java.util.zip moved into the runtime. The claim on a class
 ;; the runtime provides is dropped with a warning, not refused: a runtime
 ;; upgrade must not make every project on an older release of a library fail
 ;; to resolve. The claim on javax.crypto.SecretKeyFactory, which nothing else
 ;; provides, stands and still autoloads this namespace.
 :jolt/provides {provstale.install ["java.util.zip.CRC32"
                                    "javax.crypto.SecretKeyFactory"]}}
